title: The Jena Congress
subtitle: The party meets to settle the year's accounts.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1921 and month >= 8 and month <= 9 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and e21_jena_done = 0 and ending_id = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 10
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_jena_done = 1;
Q.e21_party = 'KPD';
Q.e21_jena_case = (Q.levi_in_party == 1) ? 2 : 1;
var hl = Q.history_luxemburgist || 0, ho = Q.history_offensive || 0, hu = Q.history_unionist || 0;
Q.e21_levi_score = hl + hu / 2 - ho + (Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction - Q.offensive_satisfaction) / 5;
Q.e21_left_ahead = (ho > hl && Q.offensive_gone != 1) ? 1 : 0;
Q.e21_left_strong = (Q.offensive_strength >= 40 && Q.offensive_gone != 1) ? 1 : 0;
Q.e21_can_readmit = (Q.e21_jena_case == 1 && Q.luxemburgist_gone != 1 && (Q.e21_levi_plea == 1 || Q.independence >= 60)) ? 1 : 0;
// a motion of Levi's friends is on the table if Levi is in the party, or his readmission can be moved
Q.e21_jena_levi_motion = (Q.luxemburgist_gone != 1 && (Q.e21_jena_case == 2 || Q.e21_can_readmit == 1)) ? 1 : 0;
Q.e21_unionist_here = (Q.unionist_gone != 1) ? 1 : 0;
Q.e21_jena_motions = (Q.e21_unionist_here ? 1 : 0) + (Q.offensive_gone != 1 ? 1 : 0) + Q.e21_jena_levi_motion;
RG.news('Party congress opens in the Volkshaus at Jena', 3);
!}

= The Jena Congress

From 22 to 26 August the party holds its congress in the Volkshaus at Jena. The delegates vote to drop the word "United" from the party's name: from now on it is the Communist Party of Germany, section of the Communist International, the **KPD**. Nobody pretends that the name is the real business.

[? if e21_jena_case = 1 and march_action = 1 : The party that began the year with [+ e21_members_jan +] thousand members has [+ members_display +] thousand left. The rest were lost to the prisons, to despair and to Levi. Those who remain want to know who is to blame, and who will lead. ?][? if e21_jena_case = 1 and march_action != 1 : Levi is gone. His friends are still in the hall, and the Left wants them gone too. ?][? if e21_jena_case = 2 and march_action = 0 : Levi is in the hall, and the party is whole. But Ruth Fischer's Berlin delegates have come to Jena to settle accounts with the leadership that refused to fight in March. ?][? if e21_jena_case = 2 and march_action != 0 : Levi is still a member, and the question of what he is to be divides the congress. ?]

The motions on the leadership go to the vote at the end of the week. [? if e21_unionist_here = 1 : Brandler, Thalheimer and Ernst Meyer ask for a Zentrale that will apply the theses of the world congress: the united front, patiently. ?][? if offensive_gone = 0 : Ruth Fischer and Arkadi Maslow ask for one that will not apologise for March. ?][? if e21_jena_levi_motion = 1 and e21_jena_case = 2 : Levi's friends ask for his line, and for him. ?][? if e21_jena_levi_motion = 1 and e21_jena_case = 1 : Levi's friends move that he and those who left with him be readmitted. ?]

[? if comrade_brandler = 2 : Brandler himself is in a fortress cell, and his motion is moved by Thalheimer. ?][? if comrade_maslow = 3 : Maslow is still in Moscow, explaining himself. ?][? if comintern_rep : [+ comintern_rep +] sits in the gallery, and takes notes. ?]

The Zentrale must decide whose motion it will fight for.

- @right: Stand with the Right's motion.
- @left: Stand with the Left's motion.
- @levi: Stand with Levi's friends.
- @alone: Put the Zentrale's own motion.

@right
view-if: e21_unionist_here = 1
subtitle: What history did, and Moscow's preference after the world congress. The Left will fight it district by district.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_jena_backing = 3;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

The Zentrale's speakers are told: Brandler's motion, and the theses of the world congress, without amendments.

- @open: The delegates take their seats.

@left
view-if: offensive_gone = 0
subtitle: The Left's hour: the defenders of the offensive ask for the party. Lenin will not be pleased.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_jena_backing = 2;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

The Zentrale throws its weight behind Ruth Fischer's motion. The Berlin delegates cannot believe their luck, and do not quite trust it.

- @open: The delegates take their seats.

@levi
view-if: e21_jena_levi_motion = 1
subtitle: The Spartacist line. [? if e21_jena_case = 1 : Lenin left the door ajar. The congress may slam it. ?][? if e21_jena_case = 2 : Levi and Zetkin lead, if the congress lets them. The Left may not stay. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_jena_backing = 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
!}

The Zentrale stands with Levi's friends. Zetkin will move the motion. In the corridors, the Left starts counting who will walk out with them if it passes.

- @open: The delegates take their seats.

@alone
view-if: e21_jena_motions = 0
subtitle: There is no one else left to fight with.
on-arrival: e21_jena_backing = 0

The Zentrale puts its own motion to the congress.

- @open: The delegates take their seats.

@open
on-arrival: {!
var pos = [];
if (Q.e21_unionist_here) { pos.push('unionist'); }
if (Q.offensive_gone != 1) { pos.push('offensive'); }
if (Q.e21_jena_levi_motion == 1) { pos.push('luxemburgist'); }
var back = {1: 'luxemburgist', 2: 'offensive', 3: 'unionist'}[Q.e21_jena_backing] || pos[0];
RG.congressStart({
    id: 'jena',
    name: 'The Jena Congress',
    stake: 'Who leads the party after the March Action, and whether the Left or Levi\'s friends stay',
    sessions: 3,
    positions: pos,
    backing: back,
    kind: 'leadership',
    mandates: 'members',
    ownClose: true
});
// the year comes to Jena with the delegates
if (Q.march_action == 1 && Q.e21_march_mode == 2 && Q.e21_unionist_here) { RG.congress.swayTo('unionist', 0.1); }
// the world congress's line, and the weight of Lenin's name behind it
if (Q.comintern_member == 1 && Q.e21_unionist_here && Q.directive_masses >= 1) {
    RG.congress.swayTo('unionist', Math.max(0, Math.min(0.06, (Q.ecci_lenin - 30) / 500)));
}
if (Q.march_action == 1 && Q.e21_march_mode == 1 && Q.e21_unionist_here) { RG.congress.swayTo('unionist', 0.04); }
if (Q.march_action == 2 && Q.offensive_gone != 1) { RG.congress.swayTo('offensive', 0.08); }
if (Q.march_action == 0 && Q.offensive_gone != 1) { RG.congress.swayTo('offensive', 0.04); }
if (Q.e21_masses_stance == 1 && Q.e21_unionist_here) { RG.congress.swayTo('unionist', 0.03); }
if (Q.e21_levi_fate == 3 && Q.e21_jena_levi_motion == 1) { RG.congress.swayTo('luxemburgist', 0.05); }
RG.congress.bitter(2);
!}

The Volkshaus is a hall built by Carl Zeiss's foundation for the workers of Jena, with a stage, a gallery and bad acoustics. [+ congress_delegates_total +] delegates have mandates. The first count of heads in the corridors gives our side [+ congress_votes_for +] per cent of them.
